graph LR
    Benchmark["llm-d-benchmark"]

    %% External Dependencies - Runtime
    Benchmark -->|Python SDK| K8s["kubernetes==35.0.0"]
    Benchmark -->|alt K8s client| Pykube["pykube-ng>=23.6.0"]
    Benchmark -->|results storage| GCSLib["google-cloud-storage>=2.10.0"]
    Benchmark -->|GCS auth| GoogleAuth["google-auth"]
    Benchmark -->|HTTP client| Requests["requests"]
    Benchmark -->|data validation| Pydantic["pydantic>=2.0"]
    Benchmark -->|tokenizer config| Transformers["transformers"]
    Benchmark -->|model metadata| HFHub["huggingface-hub"]
    Benchmark -->|config templates| Jinja2["Jinja2"]
    Benchmark -->|YAML parsing| PyYAML["PyYAML"]
    Benchmark -->|version tracking| GitPython["GitPython"]
    Benchmark -->|report schema| BenchReport["llmd-benchmark-report<br/>>=0.2.1,<0.3"]

    %% Bundled Harnesses (in container image)
    Benchmark -->|harness| InfPerf["inference-perf v0.7.0"]
    Benchmark -->|harness| VllmBench["vllm v0.30.0"]
    Benchmark -->|harness| GuideLLM["guidellm v0.7.3"]
    Benchmark -->|harness| AiPerf["aiperf v0.12.0"]
    Benchmark -->|harness| LmEval["lm-eval 0.4.12"]

    %% Platform Dependencies (consumed APIs)
    Benchmark -->|cluster mgmt| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    Benchmark -->|ingress| GatewayAPI["Gateway API CRDs"]
    Benchmark -.->|OpenShift| OSRoutes["OpenShift Routes"]
    Benchmark -.->|OpenShift| OSVersion["ClusterVersion API"]
    Benchmark -.->|monitoring| Prometheus["ServiceMonitor CRDs"]

    %% External Services
    Benchmark -->|results store| GCS["Google Cloud Storage"]
    Benchmark -->|fallback read| Prism["Prism Proxy<br/>prism.llm-d.ai"]
    Benchmark -->|model access| HFHubSvc["HuggingFace Hub"]
    Benchmark -->|load target| LLMEndpoint["LLM Inference Endpoints"]

